    "detailed_description": "MY ADAPTATION IN(TO) HUMAN is a point and click horror adventure.<br><br>Choose your human vessel and inhabit it! <br>Adapt to life in a human body in a fictional post-Soviet country.<br>Look around, socialize with others, and try to adapt to this new life.<br>Make decisions in dialogues, the ending of the game depends on it.<br><br><strong>GAME'S KEY FEATURES:</strong><br>- A unique visual style made entirely of photographs.<br>- An original story in which you play the role of a monster who has captured someone else's body.<br>- A short and dynamic story about the life of an alien creature.<br>- Easy to learn combat system.<br>- About 20 minutes per run.<br>- 2 Endings.",
